  "steps": [
    "Put all the ingredients for the oats into a heatproof bowl and stir. Place in slow cooker and cook on low overnight (4–8 hours).",
    "Stir the peanut butter powder and sweetener or sugar into the cooked oats until well combined.",
    "Spoon into bowls and top with the sliced bananas and chopped pecans, then drizzle with maple syrup."
